=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/slicers-filters-and-filter-pane/\"><span>58</span><span data-bn=\"Slicer, Filter ও Filter Pane\" data-en=\"Slicers, Filters, and the Filter Pane\">Slicers, Filters, and the Filter Pane</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"visual-interactions\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/visual-interactions/\"><span>59</span><span data-bn=\"Visual Interaction Edit করুন\" data-en=\"Edit Visual Interactions\">Edit Visual Interactions</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link current\" data-chapter-link=\"drill-down-and-hierarchies\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/drill-down-and-hierarchies/\"><span>60</span><span data-bn=\"Hierarchy দিয়ে Drill Down\" data-en=\"Drill Down with Hierarchies\">Drill Down with Hierarchies</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"drillthrough-pages\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/drillthrough-pages/\"><span>61</span><span data-bn=\"Drillthrough Page\" data-en=\"Drillthrough Pages\">Drillthrough Pages</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"report-page-tooltips\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/report-page-tooltips/\"><span>62</span><span data-bn=\"Report Page Tooltip\" data-en=\"Report Page Tooltips\">Report Page Tooltips</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"conditional-formatting-and-dynamic-titles\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/conditional-formatting-and-dynamic-titles/\"><span>63</span><span data-bn=\"Conditional Formatting ও Dynamic Title\" data-en=\"Conditional Formatting and Dynamic Titles\">Conditional Formatting and Dynamic Titles</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"bookmarks-buttons-and-page-navigation\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/bookmarks-buttons-and-page-navigation/\"><span>64</span><span data-bn=\"Bookmark, Button ও Page Navigation\" data-en=\"Bookmarks, Buttons, and Page Navigation\">Bookmarks, Buttons, and Page Navigation</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"dashboard-layout-and-information-hierarchy\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/dashboard-layout-and-information-hierarchy/\"><span>65</span><span data-bn=\"Dashboard Layout ও Information Hierarchy\" data-en=\"Dashboard Layout and Information Hierarchy\">Dashboard Layout and Information Hierarchy</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div><div class=\"tutorial-module-label\"><span>07</span><strong data-bn=\"Power BI Service, Sharing ও Security\" data-en=\"Power BI Service, Sharing, and Security\">Power BI Service, Sharing, and Security</strong></div><div class=\"tutorial-module-links\"><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"publish-from-desktop-to-service\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/publish-from-desktop-to-service/\"><span>66</span><span data-bn=\"Desktop থেকে Power BI Service-এ Publish\" data-en=\"Publish from Desktop to the Power BI Service\">Publish from Desktop to the Power BI Service</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"workspaces-roles-and-collaboration\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/workspaces-roles-and-collaboration/\"><span>67</span><span data-bn=\"Workspace, Role ও Collaboration\" data-en=\"Workspaces, Roles, and Collaboration\">Workspaces, Roles, and Collaboration</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"apps-and-audience-distribution\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/apps-and-audience-distribution/\"><span>68</span><span data-bn=\"Power BI App ও Audience Distribution\" data-en=\"Power BI Apps and Audience Distribution\">Power BI Apps and Audience Distribution</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"scheduled-refresh-and-gateways\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/scheduled-refresh-and-gateways/\"><span>69</span><span data-bn=\"Scheduled Refresh ও Data Gateway\" data-en=\"Scheduled Refresh and Data Gateways\">Scheduled Refresh and Data Gateways</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"row-level-security\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/row-level-security/\"><span>70</span><span data-bn=\"Row-level Security (RLS)\" data-en=\"Row-level Security (RLS)\">Row-level Security (RLS)</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"object-level-security-and-sensitivity-concepts\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/object-level-security-and-sensitivity-concepts/\"><span>71</span><span data-bn=\"Object-level Security ও Sensitivity Concept\" data-en=\"Object-level Security and Sensitivity Concepts\">Object-level Security and Sensitivity Concepts</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"sharing-export-and-governance\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/sharing-export-and-governance/\"><span>72</span><span data-bn=\"Sharing, Export ও Governance\" data-en=\"Sharing, Export, and Governance\">Sharing, Export, and Governance</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div><div class=\"tutorial-module-label\"><span>08</span><strong data-bn=\"Performance, Accessibility ও Quality Assurance\" data-en=\"Performance, Accessibility, and Quality Assurance\">Performance, Accessibility, and Quality Assurance</strong></div><div class=\"tutorial-module-links\"><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"performance-analyzer-and-model-performance\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/performance-analyzer-and-model-performance/\"><span>73</span><span data-bn=\"Performance Analyzer ও Model Performance\" data-en=\"Performance Analyzer and Model Performance\">Performance Analyzer and Model Performance</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"accessible-power-bi-reports\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/accessible-power-bi-reports/\"><span>74</span><span data-bn=\"Accessible Power BI Report তৈরি করুন\" data-en=\"Build Accessible Power BI Reports\">Build Accessible Power BI Reports</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"report-quality-assurance-and-release-checklist\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/report-quality-assurance-and-release-checklist/\"><span>75</span><span data-bn=\"Report Quality Assurance ও Release Checklist\" data-en=\"Report Quality Assurance and Release Checklist\">Report Quality Assurance and Release Checklist</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div><div class=\"tutorial-module-label\"><span>09</span><strong data-bn=\"Power BI Portfolio Project\" data-en=\"Power BI Portfolio Project\">Power BI Portfolio Project</strong></div><div class=\"tutorial-module-links\"><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"power-bi-project-requirements-and-model-plan\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/power-bi-project-requirements-and-model-plan/\"><span>76</span><span data-bn=\"Portfolio Project Part 1: Requirement ও Model Plan\" data-en=\"Portfolio Project Part 1: Requirements and Model Plan\">Portfolio Project Part 1: Requirements and Model Plan</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a><a class=\"tutorial-chapter-link\" data-chapter-link=\"power-bi-project-build-and-present\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/power-bi-project-build-and-present/\"><span>77</span><span data-bn=\"Portfolio Project Part 2: Build, Validate ও Present\" data-en=\"Portfolio Project Part 2: Build, Validate, and Present\">Portfolio Project Part 2: Build, Validate, and Present</span><b aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"chapter-state\">○</b></a></div></nav>\n<div class=\"tutorial-sidebar-links\"><a href=\"/exercises/power-bi-data-analytics/\">Exercises</a><a href=\"/quiz/power-bi-data-analytics/\">Final quiz</a><a href=\"/examples/power-bi-data-analytics/\">Examples</a><a href=\"/references/power-bi-data-analytics/\">References</a></div>\n</aside>\n<div class=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-backdrop\"></div>\n<article class=\"tutorial-content\" data-chapter=\"drill-down-and-hierarchies\" data-tutorial=\"power-bi-data-analytics\">\n<header class=\"tutorial-page-header\"><div>\n<span class=\"eyebrow\" data-bn=\"Reports, Visuals, and Interaction · Chapter 60 / 77\" data-en=\"Reports, Visuals, and Interaction · Chapter 60 of 77\">Reports, Visuals, and Interaction · Chapter 60 of 77</span>\n<h1 data-bn=\"Hierarchy দিয়ে Drill Down\" data-en=\"Drill Down with Hierarchies\">Drill Down with Hierarchies</h1>\n<p class=\"tutorial-lead\" data-bn=\"Hierarchy দিয়ে Drill Down ব্যবহার করে reliable Power BI data preparation, modeling, calculation, visualization বা delivery workflow তৈরি করার পদ্ধতি শিখুন।\" data-en=\"Drill features move through hierarchy levels such as Year, Quarter, Month, and Date. Users can drill one point, expand all levels, or move back up.\">Drill features move through hierarchy levels such as Year, Quarter, Month, and Date. Users can drill one point, expand all levels, or move back up.</p>\n</div><div class=\"tutorial-header-actions\"><button class=\"button ghost tutorial-drawer-open\" id=\"tutorial-drawer-open\" type=\"button\">☰ <span data-bn=\"Chapter\" data-en=\"Chapters\">Chapters</span></button><button class=\"button ghost\" onclick=\"window.print()\" type=\"button\">⎙ <span data-bn=\"Print\" data-en=\"Print\">Print</span></button></div></header>\n<div class=\"chapter-meta\"><span>◷ 45 min</span><span>Beginner</span><button class=\"button small primary\" id=\"chapter-complete\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav aria-label=\"On this chapter\" class=\"chapter-jump\"><a href=\"#objectives\">Objectives</a><a href=\"#concept-1\">Learn</a><a href=\"#worked-example\">Example</a><a href=\"#try-it\">Try it</a><a href=\"#exercises\">Exercises</a><a href=\"#summary\">Summary</a></nav>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section tutorial-objectives\" id=\"objectives\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Start here</div><h2 data-bn=\"আপনি যা শিখবেন\" data-en=\"What you will learn\">What you will learn</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"সহজ ভাষায় Hierarchy দিয়ে Drill Down explain করুন।\" data-en=\"Explain Drill Down with Hierarchies in plain language.\">Explain Drill Down with Hierarchies in plain language.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Taskটি correct Power BI layer-এ place করুন।\" data-en=\"Place the task in the correct Power BI layer.\">Place the task in the correct Power BI layer.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Retail practice model-এ concept apply করুন।\" data-en=\"Apply the concept to the retail practice model.\">Apply the concept to the retail practice model.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Output validate করে একটি limitation communicate করুন।\" data-en=\"Validate the output and communicate one limitation.\">Validate the output and communicate one limitation.</span></li></ul></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-1\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">01</div><h2 data-bn=\"Hierarchy দিয়ে Drill Down কী\" data-en=\"What Drill Down with Hierarchies means\">What Drill Down with Hierarchies means</h2><p data-bn=\"Hierarchy দিয়ে Drill Down বুঝতে feature-এর নামের পাশাপাশি data কোন layer-এ transform, model, calculate বা present হচ্ছে তা বুঝতে হবে। সঠিক layer বেছে নিলে refresh, reuse, security ও interpretation বেশি reliable হয়।\" data-en=\"Drill features move through hierarchy levels such as Year, Quarter, Month, and Date. Users can drill one point, expand all levels, or move back up. The purpose is not to memorize menu paths; it is to understand which layer owns the logic and how that choice affects refresh, reuse, security, and interpretation.\">Drill features move through hierarchy levels such as Year, Quarter, Month, and Date. Users can drill one point, expand all levels, or move back up. The purpose is not to memorize menu paths; it is to understand which layer owns the logic and how that choice affects refresh, reuse, security, and interpretation.</p><div class=\"formula-block\"><span>Power BI</span><code>Year → Quarter → Month → Date</code><button aria-label=\"Copy code\" class=\"copy-code\" data-copy-code=\"\" type=\"button\">Copy</button></div></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-2\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">02</div><h2 data-bn=\"Data analyst কীভাবে ব্যবহার করেন\" data-en=\"How a data analyst uses it\">How a data analyst uses it</h2><p data-bn=\"Data analyst Hierarchy দিয়ে Drill Down ব্যবহার করার আগে business question, source grain, expected output এবং validation rule লিখে রাখেন। কাজের পরে result reconcile করেন এবং unsupported conclusion এড়িয়ে limitation document করেন।\" data-en=\"Analysts create intentional hierarchies and provide titles or navigation cues so users understand the current level. A professional workflow records the business rule, source grain, model assumptions, and validation evidence before the output is shared.\">Analysts create intentional hierarchies and provide titles or navigation cues so users understand the current level. A professional workflow records the business rule, source grain, model assumptions, and validation evidence before the output is shared.</p></section><section class=\"tutorial-section\" id=\"concept-3\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">03</div><h2 data-bn=\"Rule, check ও common mistake\" data-en=\"Rules, checks, and common mistakes\">Rules, checks, and common mistakes</h2><p data-bn=\"Common mistake হলো wrong layer-এ logic রাখা, automatic detection verify না করা, ভিন্ন grain mix করা, unclear name ব্যবহার করা এবং visually plausible result-কে reconciliation ছাড়া trust করা। একবারে একটি change করুন, validate করুন এবং evidence সংরক্ষণ করুন।\" data-en=\"Common mistakes include placing logic in the wrong layer, relying on automatic detection without verification, mixing grains, using unclear names, and trusting a visually plausible result without reconciliation. Change one thing at a time, validate it, and preserve evidence.\">Common mistakes include placing logic in the wrong layer, relying on automatic detection without verification, mixing grains, using unclear names, and trusting a visually plausible result without reconciliation. Change one thing at a time, validate it, and preserve evidence.</p></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section key-terms\" id=\"key-terms\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Vocabulary</div><h2 data-bn=\"গুরুত্বপূর্ণ শব্দ\" data-en=\"Key terms\">Key terms</h2><div class=\"term-grid\"><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Drill down\" data-en=\"Drill down\">Drill down</h3><p data-bn=\"Drill down: Move to a lower hierarchy level for a selected item. Power BI workflow-এ term-টির exact role chapter-এর example ও activity দিয়ে যাচাই করুন.\" data-en=\"Move to a lower hierarchy level for a selected item.\">Move to a lower hierarchy level for a selected item.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Expand\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</h3><p data-bn=\"Expand: Show current and next hierarchy levels together. Power BI workflow-এ term-টির exact role chapter-এর example ও activity দিয়ে যাচাই করুন.\" data-en=\"Show current and next hierarchy levels together.\">Show current and next hierarchy levels together.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Drill up\" data-en=\"Drill up\">Drill up</h3><p data-bn=\"Drill up: Return to a higher hierarchy level. Power BI workflow-এ term-টির exact role chapter-এর example ও activity দিয়ে যাচাই করুন.\" data-en=\"Return to a higher hierarchy level.\">Return to a higher hierarchy level.</p></article><article class=\"term-card\"><h3 data-bn=\"Hierarchy level\" data-en=\"Hierarchy level\">Hierarchy level</h3><p data-bn=\"Hierarchy level: One ordered field in a drill path. Power BI workflow-এ term-টির exact role chapter-এর example ও activity দিয়ে যাচাই করুন.\" data-en=\"One ordered field in a drill path.\">One ordered field in a drill path.</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section worked-example\" id=\"worked-example\">\n<div class=\"section-kicker\">Example</div><h2 data-bn=\"Worked example: Hierarchy দিয়ে Drill Down\" data-en=\"Worked example: Drill Down with Hierarchies\">Worked example: Drill Down with Hierarchies</h2><p class=\"example-context\" data-bn=\"একজন retail analyst practice model-এ Hierarchy দিয়ে Drill Down ব্যবহার করে reproducible output তৈরি করবেন।\" data-en=\"A retail analyst must use drill down with hierarchies in the provided practice model and produce an output another reviewer can reproduce.\">A retail analyst must use drill down with hierarchies in the provided practice model and produce an output another reviewer can reproduce.</p>\n<ol class=\"worked-steps\"><li><span>1</span><p data-bn=\"Business question, audience, required metric ও expected analytical grain লিখুন।\" data-en=\"Write the business question, audience, required metric, and expected analytical grain.\">Write the business question, audience, required metric, and expected analytical grain.</p></li><li><span>2</span><p data-bn=\"Taskটি Power Query, semantic model, DAX, report layer নাকি Power BI service-এ হওয়া উচিত তা নির্ধারণ করুন।\" data-en=\"Identify whether the task belongs in Power Query, the semantic model, DAX, the report layer, or the Power BI service.\">Identify whether the task belongs in Power Query, the semantic model, DAX, the report layer, or the Power BI service.</p></li><li><span>3</span><p data-bn=\"Feature বা expression apply করে একটি input, filter বা model assumption বদলে effect observe করুন।\" data-en=\"Apply the feature or expression, then change one input, filter, or model assumption and observe the effect.\">Apply the feature or expression, then change one input, filter, or model assumption and observe the effect.</p></li><li><span>4</span><p data-bn=\"Result communicate করার আগে source total, model relationship, filter behavior ও final visual/calculation validate করুন।\" data-en=\"Validate source totals, model relationships, filter behavior, and the final visual or calculation before communicating the result.\">Validate source totals, model relationships, filter behavior, and the final visual or calculation before communicating the result.</p></li></ol>\n<div class=\"example-conclusion\"><strong data-bn=\"Conclusion\" data-en=\"Conclusion\">Conclusion</strong><p data-bn=\"Hierarchy দিয়ে Drill Down তখনই সঠিকভাবে apply হয়েছে যখন layer, grain, filter behavior ও validation evidence stated business question-কে support করে।\" data-en=\"Drill Down with Hierarchies is applied correctly only when the layer, grain, filter behavior, and validation evidence all support the stated business question.\">Drill Down with Hierarchies is applied correctly only when the layer, grain, filter behavior, and validation evidence all support the stated business question.</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section try-it-section\" id=\"try-it\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Try it yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"ধারণাটি প্র্যাকটিস করুন\" data-en=\"Practice the idea\">Practice the idea</h2><div id=\"tutorial-activity\"></div></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section exercise-section\" id=\"exercises\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Check yourself</div><h2 data-bn=\"Chapter exercise\" data-en=\"Chapter exercises\">Chapter exercises</h2><div id=\"chapter-exercises\"></div><a class=\"text-link\" href=\"/exercises/power-bi-data-analytics/\">Open the complete exercise library →</a></section>\n<section class=\"tutorial-section recap-section\" id=\"summary\"><div class=\"section-kicker\">Summary</div><h2 data-bn=\"যা মনে রাখবেন\" data-en=\"What to remember\">What to remember</h2><ul><li><span data-bn=\"Hierarchy দিয়ে Drill Down সঠিক business question ও analytical grain-এর সঙ্গে ব্যবহার করতে হবে।\" data-en=\"Drill features move through hierarchy levels such as Year, Quarter, Month, and Date.\">Drill features move through hierarchy levels such as Year, Quarter, Month, and Date.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Transformation, relationship, calculation ও presentation rule purpose অনুযায়ী correct layer-এ রাখুন।\" data-en=\"Put each transformation, relationship, calculation, and presentation rule in the layer best suited to its purpose.\">Put each transformation, relationship, calculation, and presentation rule in the layer best suited to its purpose.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Automatic detection ও visually plausible output-ও validate করতে হবে।\" data-en=\"Automatic detection and visually plausible output still require validation.\">Automatic detection and visually plausible output still require validation.</span></li><li><span data-bn=\"Publication-এর আগে definition, assumption, limitation ও evidence document করুন।\" data-en=\"Document definitions, assumptions, limitations, and evidence before publication.\">Document definitions, assumptions, limitations, and evidence before publication.</span></li></ul></section>\n<details class=\"tutorial-references\"><summary>Authoritative references</summary><ul><li><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/power-bi/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft Learn — Power BI documentation ↗</a></li><li><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dax/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Microsoft Learn — DAX reference ↗</a></li></ul></details>\n<div class=\"tutorial-complete-panel\"><div><h2 data-bn=\"পরবর্তী chapter-এর জন্য প্রস্তুত?\" data-en=\"Ready for the next chapter?\">Ready for the next chapter?</h2><p data-bn=\"ধারণাটি explain ও exercise finish করতে পারলে chapter complete mark করুন।\" data-en=\"Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.\">Mark this chapter complete after you can explain the idea and finish the exercises.</p></div><button class=\"button primary\" id=\"chapter-complete-bottom\" type=\"button\">Mark complete</button></div>\n<nav class=\"tutorial-pager\"><a class=\"tutorial-prev\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/visual-interactions/\"><small>← Previous</small><strong data-bn=\"Visual Interaction Edit করুন\" data-en=\"Edit Visual Interactions\">Edit Visual Interactions</strong></a><a class=\"tutorial-next\" href=\"/tutorials/power-bi-data-analytics/drillthrough-pages/\"><small>Next →</small><strong data-bn=\"Drillthrough Page\" data-en=\"Drillthrough Pages\">Drillthrough Pages</strong></a></nav>\n</article>\n</div></main>","scripts":["/assets/js/tutorial-core.js","/assets/js/tutorial.js"],"inlineScripts":[]}